    "name_raw": "Mindful Meditation",
    "definition_type_raw": "Meditation",
    "source_book_raw": "Blood of the Beast pg. 28",
    "definition_raw": "Source Blood of the Beast pg. 28\nYou clear your mind of stress and emotion by focusing on calming breathing exercises.\n\nPrerequisites: Wis 11, Meditation Master.\n\nBenefit: For 24 hours after you meditate, you gain a +1 bonus on Will saving throws against charm, compulsion, emotion, and fear effects, and increase the Bluff DC to feint you and the Intimidate DC to demoralize you by +5. These bonuses increase by 1 for every 5 Hit Dice you have to a maximum increase of +4 at 20 Hit Dice.",
